{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae2047b8-2582-8b06-848b-b2e4f2b873c1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T09:33:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need the new trash schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. The new schedule after the holiday week, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is this for your own home, or someone else's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My mother's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What's the address for pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "242 Carroll Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "242 Carroll Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, you're on the regular route there. Pickup got pushed back a day over the holidays, and then the storm over the weekend slowed things down too. Was her trash missed last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Hold on, sorry, I'm getting a little [inaudible] on your end. Are you on speaker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Speakerphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just want to be sure I hear you right. Sorry, you were saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. My virtual assistant keeps lighting up on the table. It thinks I'm talking to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Go ahead and let it light up. So, for 242 Carroll, the pickup is back to the normal day this week. That's Thursday for trash, and recycling goes out on the alternating weeks, so this week is a recycling week as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both this week, yes. Trash and recycling, Thursday. Then next week it's trash only, same day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there a fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fee for the pickup? No, there's no fee for the regular schedule. Just have the bins out at the curb by early morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What about the missed one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since it was the holiday delay, there's no charge for that either. Just put the extra bags out Thursday with the rest and the crew should take them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Extra bags are fine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Within reason, yes. If there's a whole lot extra, a call back is a good idea, but a few bags from the missed week is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thursday, both, no fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Thursday, trash and recycling, no fee. Do you need me to send the schedule by mail to your mother?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
